WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
The <00:00:00.160>monks' <00:00:00.520>answer <00:00:00.880>was <00:00:01.140>not <00:00:01.380>to <00:00:01.580>fight

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:02.300
harder.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.680
It <00:00:02.900>was <00:00:03.080>to <00:00:03.260>stay.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.480
Don't <00:00:04.440>argue <00:00:04.780>with <00:00:04.980>the <00:00:05.140>urge.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.140
Don't <00:00:06.280>obey <00:00:06.620>it <00:00:06.800>either.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.760
Notice <00:00:07.940>it, <00:00:08.360>and <00:00:08.740>put <00:00:08.880>your <00:00:09.080>hands <00:00:09.460>back

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.360
on <00:00:09.960>the <00:00:10.080>work.
